# === Data: large / raw / regenerable ===
data/raw/
# Plan parquets ARE tracked: they carry the original call_ids + render_ctx that
# historical logs depend on (_ctx_from_plan). Regenerated plans hash a later
# prompt version and do NOT match logged call_ids — never regenerate over these.
# Only the materials staging dir stays ignored.
data/materials/base_resumes/.staging/

